        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "8-point `run_self_test()` suite (`L828-868`) verifying SHA-256 dataset integrity, Boltzmann PIN1 pool conservation (< 1e-14) and up-the-gradient monotonicity, Turing-like transport instability threshold and NPA dispersion collapse, 2D SAM intercellular flux conservation (< 1e-11), 4 phyllotactic mode regimes, NPA block and IAA paste rescue, rosette specimen segmentation, and bitwise determinism." ;
